{"unit_id":"tag:041X:proof","translation":"我们使用引理<REF_0001>证明此结论。该引理的假设(1)和(2)由空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>得到。考虑笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagram）<MATH_0001>，其对象为<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），其中<MATH_0003>为仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism），而<MATH_0004>为开浸入（open immersion）。我们要证明<MATH_0005>为开浸入（open immersion）。注意，<MATH_0006>对应于开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0007>（同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0008>），使<MATH_0009>作为<MATH_0010>的开子概形（open subschemes）相等。因此存在开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0011>，使<MATH_0012>，见下降（Descent），引理<REF_0003>。由空间的性质，命题<REF_0004>，可知<MATH_0013>满足fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）的层条件（sheaf condition）。现在有fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0014>和元素（element）<MATH_0015>。由层条件（sheaf condition）得到态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>，使<MATH_0017>交换（commutative）。另一方面，我们知道，对于任意<MATH_0019>上的概形（scheme）<MATH_0018>以及<MATH_0020>-值点（point）<MATH_0021>，复合（composition）<MATH_0022>是态射（morphism），使<MATH_0023>经<MATH_0024>分解。显然，这意味着<MATH_0025>经<MATH_0026>分解。换言之，层（sheaves）的映射（map）<MATH_0027>是双射的（bijective），于是得证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"open subscheme","target_term":"开子概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"open subschemes","target_term":"开子概形"},{"source_term":"open subscheme","target_term":"开子概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"